 Push with an SSH key                                in C:\Projects\quiz-slayer

 In C:\Projects\quiz-slayer and every folder inside it, Git will push over SSH
 with the key C:\Users\you\.ssh\id_ed25519_devpit_work, and only that key.
 GitHub then sees the account that key belongs to. Pushes over HTTPS are not
 affected.

 Devpit will write:
   ~/.devpit/git/rules.gitconfig (changes)
     [includeIf "gitdir/i:C:/Projects/quiz-slayer/"]
     path = "ssh-1a2b3c4d.gitconfig"

